            {
                "entry_id": "0dd84a60-a44c-3a4a-a4af-1b77cb2dc338",
                "word": "hospitate",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2e4975ed-8e71-42aa-b1f2-cda1811ac740",
                        "entry_id": "0dd84a60-a44c-3a4a-a4af-1b77cb2dc338",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hospitates"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad9e6866-dc61-3e9b-8dd3-e8ef5ed883fc",
                        "entry_id": "0dd84a60-a44c-3a4a-a4af-1b77cb2dc338",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A building or set of buildings for housing non-paying guests or the sick, especially those connected to a monastery."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "90c6c3cb-0fb8-4e39-bbcf-bac58b34b82d",
                                "sense_id": "ad9e6866-dc61-3e9b-8dd3-e8ef5ed883fc",
                                "text": "The Hospitate buildings of a monastery were erected in different parts of the convent ground, according to the profession or quality of the guests."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcedf4fe-51a1-4f57-b9f1-3b1d01416c30",
                                "sense_id": "ad9e6866-dc61-3e9b-8dd3-e8ef5ed883fc",
                                "text": "Of these different classes of receipts all, except those from \"troncs, quêtes et collectes,” are enjoyed by the hospitates and asylums as well by the bureaux de bienfaisance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9508cc2e-6ca8-46ef-a687-5935ceb3e8f9",
                                "sense_id": "ad9e6866-dc61-3e9b-8dd3-e8ef5ed883fc",
                                "text": "Having now described the purely monastic buildings round the great cloister, for the abbot's lodging on the west side properly belongs to the hospitate buildings , with which it will be described , we will pass to the examination of the cloister itself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "082ca207-caa7-4e4c-899b-61388d5834b5",
                                "sense_id": "ad9e6866-dc61-3e9b-8dd3-e8ef5ed883fc",
                                "text": "This contained the granary, with an upper doorway, and also, to judge from old drawings, the main hospitate range."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1532273d-47ca-43fc-ac2f-62bb11c83f00",
                                "sense_id": "ad9e6866-dc61-3e9b-8dd3-e8ef5ed883fc",
                                "text": "Some of the hospitate buildings of the abbey were rebuilt in the 14th century, but in the 15th the more profitable plan was adopted of providing inns."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "98ac8358-0cb3-3101-ace8-c78c5f272a40",
                        "entry_id": "0dd84a60-a44c-3a4a-a4af-1b77cb2dc338",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A non-paying guest."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "393646eb-aa2b-4ae6-a6ef-bee13f02795b",
                                "sense_id": "98ac8358-0cb3-3101-ace8-c78c5f272a40",
                                "text": "On motion of Julius Freiberg, Esq., it was ordered that the resolution of this Board passed June 3, 1877, relative to the admission of Moritz Sachs, as an indigent student of this College, be rescinded, he not having passed an examination to become a pupil of the high-school, though to remain a hospitate of this Board for one month ."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
